{#
    Item Tag Indent -- the down-then-right arrow that hangs a sub-tag from the row above it

    Fills the indent in front of a nested tag with an arrow, so the hierarchy reads as structure
    instead of stray whitespace. It is 1.5rem wide per level below the top, with the arrow at its
    right edge, so a deeper arrow starts under its parent's label.
    Renders nothing for a top-level tag. Place it as the first child of a flex row.

    Used in:    _components/item/tag_filter.html.twig, _form/tag.html.twig,
                contribution/_tag_form.html.twig, admin/system/theme/gallery/comp_item_filter.html.twig
    Parameters:
        - depth (int, required) -- the tag's level, 1 for a top-level tag
#}
{% if depth > 1 %}
    <span class="is-flex is-justify-content-flex-end is-flex-shrink-0 has-text-grey-light" style="width: {{ (depth - 1) * 1.5 }}rem;" aria-hidden="true" data-item-tag-indent="{{ depth }}">
        <span class="icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-turn-up fa-rotate-90"></i></span>
    </span>
{% endif %}
